* `shiftedMaximal_le_of_bound`: `0 ≤ 𝓜_σ g ≤ a` whenever `‖g‖ ≤ a` pointwise, together with
  `bddAbove_shiftedAverage`, `shiftedMaximal_nonneg` and `shiftedAverage_le_shiftedMaximal`;
