/-- The shifted dyadic maximal function
`𝓜_σ g(x) = sup_{s ∈ ℤ} 2^{-s} ∫_{[σ 2^s, (σ+1) 2^s]} |g(x+t)| dt`. -/
def shiftedMaximal (σ : ℝ) (g : ℝ → ℂ) (x : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ⨆ s : ℤ, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-s) * ∫ t in Set.Icc (σ * 2 ^ s) ((σ + 1) * 2 ^ s), ‖g (x + t)‖

/-- The single-scale average `2^{-k} ∫_{[σ 2^k, (σ+1) 2^k]} |g(x+t)| dt` whose supremum over
`k ∈ ℤ` is `shiftedMaximal σ g x`. -/
